WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.529
Welcome to Orbit. Choices and consequences. Our focus is Second Conditional.

2
00:00:07.529 --> 00:00:15.837
Use if plus a past form, followed by would plus a base verb, for an imagined present or future situation.

3
00:00:15.837 --> 00:00:19.921
If Daniel accepted, he would live further away.

4
00:00:19.921 --> 00:00:23.610
If I had more time, I would volunteer.

5
00:00:23.610 --> 00:00:26.409
She would move if the rent were lower.

6
00:00:26.409 --> 00:00:35.807
Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.
